 has moved to Tuesday. The fee is 29 pounds, including materials. Please bring your book.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-21.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-22","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"31","explanation":"The final fee is 31 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for weaving. We first advertised Saturday, but the session has moved to Thursday. The fee is 31 pounds, including materials. Please bring your thread.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-22.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-23","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"25","explanation":"The final fee is 25 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for design. We first advertised Wednesday, but the session has moved to Friday. The fee is 25 pounds, including materials. Please bring your ruler.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-23.mp3","stage":"independent"}]}'::jsonb,true) on conflict(skill,version) do nothing;
insert into skill_lab_private.lessons(skill,module,version,content,published) values ('listening_paraphrase','listening',1,'{"skill":"listening_paraphrase","module":"listening","title":"Listen for meaning","outcome":"Connect an explanation to its concise meaning.","trap":"Audio and options rarely repeat every word.","strategy":"Identify the speaker’s purpose and match the complete meaning.","example":"You can use our tools without buying them → equipment is provided.","version":1,"basic":true,"estimated_minutes":8,"open_prompt":null,"items":[{"id":"listening_paraphrase-0","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the pottery session, you do not need to buy a studio. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-0.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-1","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the photography session, you do not need to buy a camera. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-1.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-2","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the gardening session, you do not need to buy a gloves. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-2.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-3","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the history session, you do not need to buy a notebook. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-3.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-4","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the cooking session, you do not need to buy a apron. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-4.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-5","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the cycling session, you do not need to buy a helmet. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_pa