oduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"speaking_organisation-20","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["Measuring a bean plant each week records its growth.","Schools should maintain vegetable gardens.","Growing plants helps pupils observe how food develops."],"answer":["Schools should maintain vegetable gardens.","Growing plants helps pupils observe how food develops.","Measuring a bean plant each week records its growth."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"speaking_organisation-21","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["Passengers can stay dry during a rain shower.","Stations should provide covered waiting areas.","Shelter makes waiting more comfortable in poor weather."],"answer":["Stations should provide covered waiting areas.","Shelter makes waiting more comfortable in poor weather.","Passengers can stay dry during a rain shower."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"speaking_organisation-22","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A message the previous day gives time to arrange transport.","Clinics should send appointment reminders.","A reminder helps patients remember a booking made weeks earlier."],"answer":["Clinics should send appointment reminders.","A reminder helps patients remember a booking made weeks earlier.","A message the previous day gives time to arrange transport."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea befor